# 🔑 7 Major Takeaways

### 1. 🎯 Choose one important priority every day.
Don't let your entire day be controlled by other people's priorities.

### 2. 📵 Control distractions intentionally.
Technology should serve your goals—not constantly control your attention.

### 3. 🔦 Protect your focus.
Create dedicated periods for meaningful work.

### 4. ⚡ Manage energy, not just time.
Sleep, exercise, food, and movement affect productivity.

### 5. 🚧 Add friction to distractions.
Make unwanted habits harder and useful habits easier.

### 6. 🧪 Experiment with productivity techniques.
There is no single perfect system for everyone.

### 7. 📝 Reflect and improve.
Small daily adjustments can create significant improvements over time.

